#!args apps/JFNetworker/tests/fixtures/tcp_wan.jfnet --scenario apps/JFNetworker/tests/scen/tcp_wan.scn --golden apps/JFNetworker/tests/scen/tcp_wan.report
# golden scenario: TCP over a slow, lossy line behind a router: the SYN IOS drops while it asks
# ARP, 1 MB to a discard server and 20 kB of echo with retransmissions.  The GUI program runs
# tests/scen/tcp_wan.scn on tests/fixtures/tcp_wan.jfnet without a window and ends with the
# report, which must equal tests/scen/tcp_wan.report byte for byte on every target (the script
# itself is not run)
